<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html dir="ltr" lang="en">
  <head>
    <link
      rel="preload"
      as="image"
      href=<%= "#{@phx_host}/images/email/enei-logo.png" %>
    />
    <link
      rel="preload"
      as="image"
      href=<%= "#{@phx_host}/images/email/void.jpg" %>
    />
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" />
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting" />
    <!--$-->
    <style>
      u + .body .gmail-blend-screen { background:#000; mix-blend-mode:screen; }
      u + .body .gmail-blend-difference { background:#000; mix-blend-mode:difference; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <div
    style="display:none;overflow:hidden;line-height:1px;opacity:0;max-height:0;max-width:0"
  >
    🎉 Inscreveste-te para o ENEI&#x27;26! Aqui está o que precisas de saber.
    <div>
       ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿ ‌​‍‎‏﻿
    </div>
  </div>
  <body
    style='background-color:#ffffff;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Oxygen-Sans,Ubuntu,Cantarell,"Helvetica Neue",sans-serif'
  >
    <head></head>
    <table
      align="center"
      width="100%"
      border="0"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      role="presentation"
      style="max-width:37.5em;background-color:#ffffff;margin:0 auto;padding:0 0 48px"
    >
      <tbody>
        <tr style="width:100%">
          <td>
            <div
              style="padding-top:1.25rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;background-color:#811824;background-image:linear-gradient(#811824, #811824)"
            >
              <div class="gmail-blend-difference">
                <div class="gmail-blend-screen">
                  <img
                    alt="ENEI Logo"
                    src=<%= "#{@phx_host}/images/email/enei-logo.png" %>
                    style="margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;display:block;outline:none;border:none;height:90px;text-decoration:none;filter:invert(0%)"
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p
              style="font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.75rem;font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin:16px 0"
            >
              <br />Está confirmado,
              vemo-nos no ENEI&#x27;26!
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;margin:16px 0;padding:0 16px"
            >
              Prepara-te para explorar perspetivas de vanguarda e conectares-te com os líderes da indústria. Estamos ansiosos por conhecer-te no ENEI’26!
            </p>
            <p
              style="font-size:16px;line-height:26px;margin:16px 0;padding:0 16px"
            >
              Até breve,<br /><span style="color:rgb(100,116,139)"
                >Equipa do ENEI</span
              >
            </p>
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <!--/$-->
  </body>
</html>
